      "role": "cite",
      "name": "habeas:coverage",
      "commentary": "The agent asks only for outgoing edges and submits without reading\n contents. Contents requires a formatter, but any\n rendering would imply an unwanted content input. Other agent tests\n exercise rendering with explicitly requested contents."
